{"seq":1,"slug":"contrastive-learning","title":"对比学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/text-embeddings-representation/training/contrastive-learning","wordCount":1737,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"对比学习\">对比学习</h1><p>如果只能用一句话概括现代嵌入模型为什么强，那就是：它们都在学同一件事——<strong>把语义相近的拉到一起，把语义无关的推开</strong>。这个朴素到几乎像废话的目标，写成可优化的数学，就是对比学习。它是把上一章那个各向异性、塌缩在锥形里的 BERT 原始空间，撑成一个语义可分的好嵌入空间的引擎。这一篇拥有&quot;训练目标&quot;这个主题：InfoNCE 损失、温度系数、批内负样本、双塔结构都在这里讲透，后续凡提到对比损失都默认你已掌握。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>对比学习的训练数据是&quot;对&quot;：一个锚点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>（anchor，比如一条查询），一个正样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（与它相关，比如能回答它的文档），以及若干负样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（与它无关）。训练目标是让锚点和正样本的相似度，明显高于锚点和所有负样本的相似度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;锚点 q&lt;br/&gt;如何重置密码&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;编码器&quot;]&#10;  B[&quot;正样本 d+&lt;br/&gt;密码重置步骤&quot;] --&gt; E&#10;  C[&quot;负样本 d1-&lt;br/&gt;修改用户名&quot;] --&gt; E&#10;  D[&quot;负样本 d2-&lt;br/&gt;今天的天气&quot;] --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;归一化嵌入&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;对比损失 InfoNCE&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;拉近 q 与 d+&lt;br/&gt;推远 q 与 d-&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I[&quot;语义可分的嵌入空间&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"锚点 q&lt;br/&gt;如何重置密码\"] --&gt; E[\"编码器\"]\n  B[\"正样本 d+&lt;br/&gt;密码重置步骤\"] --&gt; E\n  C[\"负样本 d1-&lt;br/&gt;修改用户名\"] --&gt; E\n  D[\"负样本 d2-&lt;br/&gt;今天的天气\"] --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[\"归一化嵌入\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"对比损失 InfoNCE\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"拉近 q 与 d+&lt;br/&gt;推远 q 与 d-\"]\n  H --&gt; I[\"语义可分的嵌入空间\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>锚点 anchor</td>\n<td>参照样本（查询）</td>\n<td>损失围绕它展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正样本 positive</td>\n<td>与锚点语义相关</td>\n<td>被拉近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负样本 negative</td>\n<td>与锚点无关</td>\n<td>被推远</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>缩放相似度的超参</td>\n<td>控制区分难度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批内负样本</td>\n<td>同批其他样本的正例</td>\n<td>免费的负样本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"infonce-对比损失的标准形式\">InfoNCE：对比损失的标准形式</h2><p>现代嵌入训练几乎都用 InfoNCE 损失（也叫 NT-Xent，归一化温度交叉熵）。它的形式本质上是一个把&quot;挑出正样本&quot;当作分类任务的 softmax 交叉熵。对一个锚点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>、它的正样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和负样本集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{d^-_j\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2244em;vertical-align:-0.413em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，损失为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = -\\log \\frac{\\exp(\\text{sim}(q, d^+)/\\tau)}{\\exp(\\text{sim}(q, d^+)/\\tau) + \\sum_{j}\\exp(\\text{sim}(q, d^-_j)/\\tau)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5856em;vertical-align:-1.1373em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4483em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2985em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6973em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1373em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sim}(\\cdot,\\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 通常是归一化后的余弦相似度（即归一化向量的点积，原理见<a href=\"../foundations/vector-spaces-similarity\">向量空间与相似度</a>）。直观理解：分子是正样本的&quot;得分指数&quot;，分母是正样本加所有负样本的得分指数之和。最小化这个损失，等价于让模型在&quot;正样本 + 一堆负样本&quot;这个候选集里，把概率质量尽量压到正样本上。它在做的，正是一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(N+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 选 1 的分类。</p>\n<p>InfoNCE 的优雅之处在于：它不需要绝对的相似度标签（不需要知道&quot;这两句相似度是 0.8&quot;），只需要相对的偏序（&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 更相关&quot;）。这种弱监督让海量自然存在的正样本对——问答对、标题正文对、翻译对、点击日志——都能直接拿来训练。</p>\n<h2 id=\"温度系数-被低估的关键旋钮\">温度系数：被低估的关键旋钮</h2><p>公式里那个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>（温度）看似不起眼，却深刻影响训练效果，是最容易调错的超参之一。它对相似度做缩放：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sim</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sim}/\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，缩放后的差距被放大，softmax 越&quot;尖锐&quot;，模型对难负样本（那些相似度接近正样本的负样本）越敏感，惩罚越重；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，分布越平滑，模型对所有负样本一视同仁，但区分力下降。</p>\n<p>实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 常取 0.01 到 0.1。一个反直觉的现象是：过小的温度会让模型过度关注最难的几个负样本，可能放大假负样本（实际相关却被当成负样本）的伤害——而假负样本恰恰是<a href=\"hard-negatives-mining\">难负样本挖掘</a>里要小心处理的核心陷阱。温度和难负样本的强度是一对需要联调的旋钮：负样本越难，温度往往要相应调高一点以稳住训练。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批内负样本-把整个-batch-变成负样本池\">批内负样本：把整个 batch 变成负样本池</h2><p>对比学习需要大量负样本，但为每个锚点单独准备负样本既费事又费内存。一个巧妙的工程技巧是<strong>批内负样本</strong>（in-batch negatives）：一个 batch 里有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(q_i, d^+_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0883em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 对，对锚点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而言，同 batch 里其他所有样本的正例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^+_j (j\\neq i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2244em;vertical-align:-0.413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 都可以当作它的负样本。这样一个 batch 就免费提供了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个负样本，几乎零额外成本。</p>\n<p>这解释了为什么对比训练对 batch size 极度敏感——batch 越大，每个锚点见到的负样本越多，对比信号越强。这也是大公司能训出强嵌入模型的一个隐性优势：它们能用上千甚至上万的 batch size。一些技术（如跨设备收集负样本、梯度缓存）专门用来在有限显存下放大有效 batch。但批内负样本有个天然弱点：随机采的负样本大多太&quot;简单&quot;（明显无关），模型很快就能轻松区分，学不到精细的语义边界。要突破这个上限，必须主动引入难负样本，这正是本章第三篇的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双塔结构与训练-推理的对称性\">双塔结构与训练-推理的对称性</h2><p>对比学习落到文本嵌入，标准载体是<strong>双编码器</strong>（bi-encoder，也叫双塔）：查询和文档各过一个编码器（通常共享权重），各自得到一个独立向量，再算相似度。这与交叉编码器形成对比——后者把查询和文档拼在一起送进模型，能建模更细的交互但无法预先编码。双塔的杀手锏是：文档可以离线编码、入库一次，查询时只需编码查询再做向量检索，推理极快、可扩展到亿级语料。这个结构最早由 <a href=\"../foundations/word2vec-to-transformers\">Sentence-BERT</a> 确立。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q[&quot;查询塔&lt;br/&gt;编码 query&quot;] --&gt; QV[&quot;查询向量&quot;]&#10;  D[&quot;文档塔&lt;br/&gt;编码 doc&lt;br/&gt;可共享权重&quot;] --&gt; DV[&quot;文档向量&quot;]&#10;  QV --&gt; S[&quot;相似度&lt;br/&gt;点积&quot;]&#10;  DV --&gt; S&#10;  S --&gt; L[&quot;InfoNCE 损失&quot;]&#10;  DV -.离线预编码.-&gt; IDX[&quot;向量库&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  Q[\"查询塔&lt;br/&gt;编码 query\"] --&gt; QV[\"查询向量\"]\n  D[\"文档塔&lt;br/&gt;编码 doc&lt;br/&gt;可共享权重\"] --&gt; DV[\"文档向量\"]\n  QV --&gt; S[\"相似度&lt;br/&gt;点积\"]\n  DV --&gt; S\n  S --&gt; L[\"InfoNCE 损失\"]\n  DV -.离线预编码.-&gt; IDX[\"向量库\"]</pre><p>双塔的非对称用法（查询和文档用不同指令编码）是检索嵌入的进阶技巧，留给<a href=\"../advanced/instruction-task-embeddings\">指令与任务嵌入</a>。这里你只需记住：对比损失训练的，正是这个双塔结构，而它的推理高效性正是嵌入能用于大规模检索的根本原因。对比学习作为一种跨越文本与视觉的通用自监督范式，更广的脉络见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../self-supervised-contrastive/contrastive/contrastive-objectives\">44_self-supervised-contrastive</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>对比学习把&quot;拉近相关、推远无关&quot;写成可优化目标，是撑开嵌入空间、修复各向异性的引擎。</li>\n<li>InfoNCE 损失把挑选正样本建模为 softmax 分类，只需相对偏序、不需绝对标签，能利用海量自然正样本对。</li>\n<li>温度系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制对难负样本的敏感度，过小会放大假负样本伤害，需与负样本难度联调。</li>\n<li>批内负样本让一个 batch 免费提供 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个负样本，使训练对 batch size 高度敏感。</li>\n<li>双编码器结构让文档可离线编码、查询时高效检索，是嵌入支撑大规模检索的根本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>如何把对比损失用在句子粒度：<a href=\"sentence-embeddings\">句子嵌入</a></li>\n<li>难负样本如何突破批内负样本的上限：<a href=\"hard-negatives-mining\">难负样本挖掘</a></li>\n<li>双塔的非对称指令用法：<a href=\"../advanced/instruction-task-embeddings\">指令与任务嵌入</a></li>\n<li>对比学习的通用范式与图像应用：<a href=\"../../self-supervised-contrastive/contrastive/contrastive-objectives\">44_self-supervised-contrastive / 对比目标</a>（跨 hub）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"对比学习","id":"对比学习"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"InfoNCE：对比损失的标准形式","id":"infonce-对比损失的标准形式"},{"level":2,"text":"温度系数：被低估的关键旋钮","id":"温度系数-被低估的关键旋钮"},{"level":2,"text":"批内负样本：把整个 batch 变成负样本池","id":"批内负样本-把整个-batch-变成负样本池"},{"level":2,"text":"双塔结构与训练-推理的对称性","id":"双塔结构与训练-推理的对称性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"从 word2vec 到 transformer","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/text-embeddings-representation/foundations/word2vec-to-transformers"},"next":{"title":"句子嵌入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/text-embeddings-representation/training/sentence-embeddings"}}